Scope notes

- This licence covers the original source code and documentation in this
  repository (the `solutions/` concepts and the helper scripts and notes in
  `materials/`). Each concept folder also carries its own copy of this
  licence.
- The ACE wind turbine data shown by the displays is not part of the
  Software. It is published by Ambition Community Energy (ACE) under
  CC BY 4.0 — see https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22662372.
- `materials/challenge-repo-guides/` contains reference copies of documents
  from the WeDoWind ODE ACE Challenge repository
  (https://github.com/WeDoWind/WeDoWind-ODE-ACE-Challenge), which keep the
  licence terms of that repository.
- `materials/api-reference/` and `materials/api-samples/` are verbatim
  responses from the public ACE API, kept for reference; they are ACE data
  under CC BY 4.0, not original work.
